==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Make sure that [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] hits the base with any Attack Up [[Cat Combo]] so his Explosion kills Raynard instantly. Then, lure the Sir Metal Seals near your base so the Surge Base can't do anything while you safely dispose of them.

